<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</link><description>BC Partners 的信贷部门已同意购买 GSE Worldwide 的多数股权，GSE Worldwide 是一家体育营销机构，代表高尔夫名人布赖森·德尚博 (Bryson DeChambeau) 和前 NFL 和 MLB 球星博·杰克逊 (Bo Jackson) 等运动员。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list'&gt;BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BC Partners Buys GSE Agency With Golfer DeChambeau on List&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>房屋建筑商股票在经历 2008 年以来最长的暴跌后仍将持续困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008</link><description>房屋建筑商即将迎来一个不祥的市场里程碑，该集团的股价将连续三年下跌，这是自次贷危机导致全球金融危机以来最长的一次下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008'&gt;房屋建筑商股票在经历 2008 年以来最长的暴跌后仍将持续困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Homebuilder Stock Woes to Persist After Longest Slump Since 2008&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:01:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Enters Bear Market Territory as AI Angst Fuels Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</link><description>银行正在向 CVC Capital Partners Plc 提供高达 110 亿欧元（合 120 亿美元）的债务融资，用于收购 Verisure Plc，因为这家收购公司在经历了公开市场艰难的一年后，正在考虑将家庭安全集团重新归私人所有。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover'&gt;银行为 CVC 可能收购 Verisure 提供 110 亿欧元债务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Banks Pitch CVC €11 Billion Debt for Possible Verisure Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/banks-pitch-cvc-11-billion-debt-for-possible-verisure-takeover</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:07:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>量化基金很难跟上股票波动的步伐</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market</link><description>股市的叙事变化如此之快，即使是所谓的快钱也跟不上。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market'&gt;量化基金很难跟上股票波动的步伐&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Quant Funds Are Having a Hard Time Keeping Up With Stock Swings&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:36:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>